{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19276","headline":"令狐相公见示新栽蕙兰二草之什兼命同作 · 刘禹锡","name":"令狐相公见示新栽蕙兰二草之什兼命同作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上国庭前草，移来汉水浔。\n朱门虽易地，玉树有余阴。\n艳彩凝还泛，清香绝复寻。\n光华童子佩，柔软美人心。\n惜晚含远思，赏幽空独吟。\n寄言知音者，一奏风中琴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19276.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19276","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}